<p align="center"><font face="Tempus Sans ITC"><strong>And for
those of you who are </strong><strong><u>REALLY</u></strong><strong>
into roleplaying in the lands of Norrath, here are some common
words and phrases:</strong> </font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">anon (until later) </font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">morrow (day) </font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">e'en (even/evening) </font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">fare-thee-well (goodbye) </font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">aye/yea (yes)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">nay (no) </font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">ne'r (never)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">oft (often) </font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">wherefore (why)&nbsp; </font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">mayhap/perchance/belike (maybe) </font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">enow (enough) </font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">aroint (away) </font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">verily (very/truly) </font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">prithee/pray (please)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">An thou likest (please)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">An it please you (please)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">An thou wilt (by your will)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">fie (a curse) </font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">grammarcy (thank you)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">I thank thee (thank you)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">Many thanks (thank you)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">forsooth (tis true)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">stay (to wait)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">ta'en (mistaken for)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">poppet (doll)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">Sweeting (honey)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">thou (you) ie. How art thou?</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">thy (your)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">thee (you personal) ie. (I wish to travel
with thee.)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">very well (all right)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">'tis done (it is done)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">as you will (okay)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">Fie me! (wow!)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">'Zounds! (God's wounds)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">What ho?! (hey!)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">Certes!&nbsp;(certainly) ie. Certes I
forgot that!</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">Forgive me (excuse me) </font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">Beg pardon (excuse me)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">Pray pardon (excuse me) </font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">By your leave (excuse me) </font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">Huzzah! (yay!)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">Privy, Jakes, Ajax (bathroom)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">Hello! (exclaimation of surprise)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">Good Day (hello)</font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">Good Morrow (good afternoon) </font></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><font
face="Tempus Sans ITC">How now (hello there)</font></p>

<p align="center"><img src="graphicsbar.gif"
width="350" height="32"></p>

